EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM e JOIN t ON e.a = t.a;
                               QUERY PLAN                               
------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Hash Join
                     Hash Cond: (a = t.a)
                     ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                           Hash Key: a
                           ->  Custom Scan (TestOrcaRegion)
                                 Region: read
                     ->  Hash
                           ->  Seq Scan on t
 Optimizer: GPORCA
(12 rows)

SELECT count(*) FROM e JOIN t ON e.a = t.a;
